        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b2c906e-d66d-4d88-a578-a626e29acf6e).Image",
        "Description": "Good Day 47,\rAccording to today&#39;s newspaper, the population of the flamingos in the world has increased by 40%. This has lead to a disruption in the food chain. So the government has allowed to hunt flamingos.\rThe timing of this news couldn&#39;t have been better.\rYou can use this story as a cover-up to eliminate the two mascots that are our client&#39;s targets.\r\rNote - You may use the Bartoli Hunting Shotgun Deluxe with the Hunter&#39;s Briefcase.\r\rGood Luck.\r\rBy - SW\r\r\n\r\n<HCCE>",
